      "fontSize": "24px",
      "color": "rgb(0, 0, 0)"
    },
    {
      "content": "Inside, they storecollected seeds and fruits. Their other flexible tentacles\nallow them to climb easily and handle food with precision. Curious and\nactive, they gather in noisy colonies that bring life to the cliffs they inhabit.",
